# Enquiry form delivery. Without these three, /api/enquiry returns 503 and the form
# tells visitors to use WhatsApp, it never silently swallows an enquiry.
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Resend is used over plain HTTPS (no SDK needed);
# swap the fetch in app/api/enquiry/route.ts for any other provider you prefer.
#
# ENQUIRY_TO_EMAIL is where enquiries land. It is never rendered on the page, so
# it can be the operator's own inbox even though their company name is kept off
# the front end. ENQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL is public, it appears in the sender header,
# so it has to stay on the brand domain.
RESEND_API_KEY=
ENQUIRY_TO_EMAIL=
ENQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL=enquiries@gokyolaketrek.com
